    "settings": {
      "instructions": "Search Console server based on https://github.com/AminForou/mcp-gsc. Start with list_properties. site_url must exactly match the returned URL-prefix or sc-domain property; pass it unencoded. OAuth scope https://www.googleapis.com/auth/webmasters includes writes. add_site, delete_site, submit_sitemap and delete_sitemap modify the authenticated user's property configuration. Add does not verify ownership; delete sitemap does not delete the remote file or indexed pages. Execute writes only for an explicitly requested property/sitemap and re-read afterwards. Compare periods with two search analytics calls; get an overview with aggregate and dimension queries. Batch inspections by repeating inspect_url, at most 10 per batch. Use the full get_search_analytics schema for advanced filters and dates. API top rows are not a full export. Reauthentication happens through the MCP client's OAuth reconnection, not a shell command."
    }
